            <ArticleTitle>Perforated jejunal diverticulitis: a rare presentation of acute abdomen.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>367-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Jejunal diverticulosis is a rare clinical finding with possible serious complications. A case of acute abdomen due to a perforated jejunal diverticulum is discussed, followed by a literature review concerning aetiology, symptoms, complications, diagnosis and treatment is provided.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
